  "instructions": [
    "Blend tamarind paste, sugar, water, and a pinch of salt to form a thick paste.",
    "Roll the paste into 1cm diameter balls and set aside.",
    "Heat sunflower oil in a wok over high heat until shimmering.",
    "Add garlic, ginger, and ground Sichuan peppercorn and stir for 10 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Add the squid strips, stirring quickly so the meat stays firm and cooks in 1 minute.",
    "Toss in the tamarind balls, salt, and pepper, cooking for an additional 30 seconds.",
    "Scatter scallions and sesame seeds over the dish and give one final quick stir.",
    "Serve immediately with a side of steamed rice."
